data: {
    "logs": "\u001b[35m[Finalize] todos_count=0, todos_with_results=0\u001b[0m\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u2705 Agent Final Answer \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Agent: Universal Cloud Architect                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Final Answer:                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  PROJECT_SLUG: azure-aks-public-cluster-modern                               \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ```mermaid                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  graph TD                                                                    \u2502\n\u2502      User[User / DevOps] -->|HTTPS/443| AKS[Azure Kubernetes                 \u2502\n\u2502  Service<br/>AKS Cluster<br/>Public Endpoint]                                \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Pull Images| ACR[Azure Container Registry<br/>Managed Identity  \u2502\n\u2502  Access]                                                                     \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Logs/Metrics| LAWS[Log Analytics Workspace<br/>Container        \u2502\n\u2502  Insights]                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502      VNet[Virtual Network] --> Subnet1[Subnet 1<br/>Availability Zone        \u2502\n\u2502  1<br/>AKS Node Pool]                                                        \u2502\n\u2502      VNet --> Subnet2[Subnet 2<br/>Availability Zone 2<br/>NAT Gateway]      \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet1 --> AKS                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet2 --> NAT[NAT Gateway<br/>Outbound Internet Access]               \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Pods| Subnet1                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ### Terraform Configuration                                                 \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 1. `versions.tf`                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  terraform {                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    required_version = \">= 1.6.0\"                                             \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    required_providers {                                                      \u2502\n\u2502      azurerm = {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        source  = \"hashicorp/azurerm\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502        version = \">= 4.0.0\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502      kubernetes = {                                                          \u2502\n\u2502        source  = \"hashicorp/kubernetes\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502        version = \">= 2.0.0\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 2. `provider.tf`                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  terraform {                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    backend \"local\" {                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      path = \"./terraform.tfstate\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  provider \"azurerm\" {                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    features {}                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  provider \"kubernetes\" {                                                     \u2502\n\u2502    host                   =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].host                         \u2502\n\u2502    client_certificate     =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].client_certifi  \u2502\n\u2502  cate)                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    client_key             =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].client_key)     \u2502\n\u2502    cluster_ca_certificate =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].cluster_ca_cer  \u2502\n\u2502  tificate)                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 3. `variables.tf`                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"location\" {                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Azure region for resources\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"East US\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"resource_group_name\" {                                            \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Name of the resource group\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"rg-aks-prod\"                                               \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"vnet_address_space\" {                                             \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Address space for the Virtual Network\"                     \u2502\n\u2502    type        = list(string)                                                \u2502\n\u2502    default     = [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]                                             \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"subnet_prefixes\" {                                                \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Subnet address prefixes\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    type        = list(string)                                                \u2502\n\u2502    default     = [\"10.0.1.0/24\", \"10.0.2.0/24\"]                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"k8s_version\" {                                                    \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Kubernetes version for AKS\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = null # Will pull latest stable                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"acr_sku\" {                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"ACR SKU\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"Premium\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"tags\" {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Common tags for all resources\"                             \u2502\n\u2502    type        = map(string)                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    default     = {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      Environment = \"Production\"                                              \u2502\n\u2502      ManagedBy   = \"Terraform\"                                               \u2502\n\u2502      Project     = \"AKS-Public-Cluster\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 4. `main.tf`                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  # Data source for latest stable AKS version                                 \u2502\n\u2502  data \"azurerm_kubernetes_versions\" \"latest\" {                               \u2502\n\u2502    location = var.location                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Resource Group                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_resource_group\" \"main\" {                                  \u2502\n\u2502    name     = var.resource_group_name                                        \u2502\n\u2502    location = var.location                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    tags     = var.tags                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Virtual Network and Subnets (2 AZs)                                       \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_virtual_network\" \"main\" {                                 \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"vnet-aks-main\"                                     \u2502\n\u2502    address_space       = var.vnet_address_space                              \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet\" \"aks_subnet\" {                                    \u2502\n\u2502    count                   = 2                                               \u2502\n\u2502    name                    = \"subnet-aks-${count.index}\"                     \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name     = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                \u2502\n\u2502    virtual_network_name    = azurerm_virtual_network.main.name               \u2502\n\u2502    address_prefixes        = [var.subnet_prefixes[count.index]]              \u2502\n\u2502    enforce_private_link_endpoint_network_policies = false                    \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # NAT Gateway for Outbound                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway\" \"main\" {                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"nat-gateway-aks\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    sku_name            = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway_public_ip\" \"main\" {                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"nat-gateway-pip-aks\"                               \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502    allocation_method   = \"Static\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway_association\" \"main\" {                         \u2502\n\u2502    nat_gateway_id = azurerm_nat_gateway.main.id                              \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[1].id                          \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Route Table                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_route_table\" \"main\" {                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"rt-aks-internal\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_route\" \"main\" {                                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                   = \"route-internet\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    address_prefix         = \"0.0.0.0/0\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    route_table_id         = azurerm_route_table.main.id                      \u2502\n\u2502    next_hop_type          = \"VirtualAppliance\"                               \u2502\n\u2502    next_hop_in_ip_address = azurerm_nat_gateway.main.private_ip_address      \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet_route_table_association\" \"main\" {                  \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[1].id                          \u2502\n\u2502    route_table_id = azurerm_route_table.main.id                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # NSGs                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_group\" \"main\" {                          \u2502\n\u2502    count             = 2                                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name              = \"nsg-aks-subnet-${count.index}\"                       \u2502\n\u2502    location          = var.location                                          \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags              = var.tags                                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main\" {                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowSSH\"                                  \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1001                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"22\"                                       \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main_http\" {                      \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowHTTP\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1002                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"80\"                                       \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main_https\" {                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowHTTPS\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1003                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"443\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet_network_security_group_association\" \"main\" {       \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[count.index].id                \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_id =                                               \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].id                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Azure Container Registry                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_container_registry\" \"main\" {                              \u2502\n\u2502    name                     = \"acraksprod001\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name      = azurerm_resource_group.main.name               \u2502\n\u2502    location                 = var.location                                   \u2502\n\u2502    sku                      = var.acr_sku                                    \u2502\n\u2502    admin_enabled            = false                                          \u2502\n\u2502    tags                     = var.tags                                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Log Analytics Workspace                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_log_analytics_workspace\" \"main\" {                         \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"law-aks-prod\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"PerGB2018\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502    retention_in_days   = 30                                                  \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_monitor_container_insights\" \"main\" {                      \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    workspace_id        = azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.main.id             \u2502\n\u2502    cluster_name        = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.name                \u2502\n\u2502    kubernetes_version  = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kubernetes_version  \u2502\n\u2502    depends_on          = [azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main]                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # AKS Cluster                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_kubernetes_cluster\" \"main\" {                              \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"aks-prod-cluster\"                                  \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    dns_prefix          = \"aksprod\"                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    linux_profile {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      admin_username = \"azureuser\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502      ssh_key {                                                               \u2502\n\u2502        key_data = file(\"~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub\")                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    network_profile {                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      network_plugin     = \"azure\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502      load_balancer_sku = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    addon_profile {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      oms_agent {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        enabled    = true                                                     \u2502\n\u2502        log_analytics_workspace_resource_id =                                 \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.main.id                                     \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    identity {                                                                \u2502\n\u2502      type         = \"SystemAssigned\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    oidc_issuer_profile {                                                     \u2502\n\u2502      enabled = true                                                          \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    workload_identity_enabled = true                                          \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    api_profile {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502      version = \"2023-08-01\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    azure_radial_dns_prefix_enabled = false                                   \u2502\n\u2502    default_node_pool {                                                       \u2502\n\u2502      name            = \"systempool\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502      node_count      = 2                                                     \u2502\n\u2502      vm_size         = \"Standard_D16s_v5\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502      os_disk_size_gb = 128                                                   \u2502\n\u2502      vnet_subnet_id  = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[0].id                       \u2502\n\u2502      zones           = [\"1\", \"2\"] # Requested multi-az                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    tags = var.tags                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    lifecycle {                                                               \u2502\n\u2502      ignore_changes = [                                                      \u2502\n\u2502        default_node_pool[0].node_count                                       \u2502\n\u2502      ]                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # AKS Node Pool (Autoscaling)                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_kubernetes_node_pool\" \"autoscaling\" {                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                  = \"autoscalingpool\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    kubernetes_cluster_id = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.id                \u2502\n\u2502    node_count            = 2 # Initial count                                 \u2502\n\u2502    vm_size               = \"Standard_D16s_v5\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    os_disk_size_gb       = 128                                               \u2502\n\u2502    vnet_subnet_id        = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[0].id                   \u2502\n\u2502    zones                 = [\"1\", \"2\"]                                        \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    enable_auto_scaling = true                                                \u2502\n\u2502    min_count           = 2                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    max_count           = 5                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    os_sku               = \"UbuntuLTS\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    mode                 = \"User\"                                             \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    tags = var.tags                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Role Assignment: AKS to ACR                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_role_assignment\" \"main\" {                                 \u2502\n\u2502    scope                = azurerm_container_registry.main.id                 \u2502\n\u2502    role_definition_name = \"AcrPull\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502    principal_id         =                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.identity[0].principal_id                    \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 5. `outputs.tf`                                                        \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  output \"cluster_name\" {                                                     \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"The name of the AKS cluster\"                               \u2502\n\u2502    value       = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.name                        \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  output \"cluster_kube_config\" {                                              \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Base64 encoded kubeconfig file\"                            \u2502\n\u2502    value       =                                                             \u2502\n\u2502  base64encode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config_raw)               \u2502\n\u2502    sensitive   = true                                                        \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  output \"acr_login_server\" {                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"The ACR login server URI\"                                  \u2502\n\u2502    value       = azurerm_container_registry.main.login_server                \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  output \"oidc_issuer_url\" {                                                  \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"The OIDC issuer URL of the cluster\"                        \u2502\n\u2502    value       =                                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.oidc_issuer_profile[0].issuer_url           \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256f\n\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udccb Task Completion \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Task Completed                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Name: Analyze the following infrastructure requirement and design a         \u2502\n\u2502  MINIMAL architecture.                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  Requirement: Create a production-valid Terraform configuration for Azure    \u2502\n\u2502  AKS with:                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  * AKS private cluster NOT enabled                                           \u2502\n\u2502  * public Kubernetes API server endpoint enabled                             \u2502\n\u2502  * system node pool using Standard_D16s_v5 VM size                           \u2502\n\u2502  * node pool autoscaling enabled                                             \u2502\n\u2502  * minimum node count = 2                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  * maximum node count = 5                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  * minimum 2 subnets across different availability zones                     \u2502\n\u2502  * Virtual Network (VNet)                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  * subnets                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  * route tables                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  * NSGs (Network Security Groups)                                            \u2502\n\u2502  * subnet associations                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  * NAT Gateway for outbound internet access                                  \u2502\n\u2502  * Azure Container Registry (ACR)                                            \u2502\n\u2502  * managed identity enabled                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  * required role assignments for AKS to pull images from ACR                 \u2502\n\u2502  * Azure CNI networking                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  * RBAC enabled                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  * OIDC issuer enabled                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  * workload identity enabled                                                 \u2502\n\u2502  * Log Analytics Workspace                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  * Azure Monitor Container Insights enabled                                  \u2502\n\u2502  * provider.tf and versions.tf                                               \u2502\n\u2502  * variables.tf                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  * outputs.tf                                                                \u2502\n\u2502  * Terraform azurerm provider v4+                                            \u2502\n\u2502  * code must pass terraform validate                                         \u2502\n\u2502  * code should be deployable without modification                            \u2502\n\u2502  * use best practices for production AKS                                     \u2502\n\u2502  * include tags on all resources                                             \u2502\n\u2502  * avoid deprecated Terraform arguments                                      \u2502\n\u2502  * use latest stable AKS version available from data source                  \u2502\n\u2502  * expose kubeconfig output securely                                         \u2502\n\u2502  * configure node resource group automatically                               \u2502\n\u2502  * include lifecycle and dependency handling where required                  \u2502\n\u2502  * generate complete modular Terraform structure                             \u2502\n\u2502  * ensure compatibility with Terraform 1.6+                                  \u2502\n\u2502  IMPORTANT: DO NOT add NAT Gateways, Private Subnets, or Multi-AZ unless     \u2502\n\u2502  explicitly requested.                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  1. Identify necessary providers and resources.                              \u2502\n\u2502  2. You MUST provide a **Mermaid.js diagram string** representing the        \u2502\n\u2502  architecture.                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  3. The first line of your response must be: PROJECT_SLUG: <slug>            \u2502\n\u2502     - The slug MUST be a descriptive kebab-case name derived from the        \u2502\n\u2502  requirement (e.g., \"eks-public-cluster\", \"s3-versioned-bucket\").            \u2502\n\u2502     - NEVER use generic names like \"terraform-project\" or timestamps.        \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  EKS-SPECIFIC RULES:                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  - If creating EKS, ALWAYS include at least 2 public subnets in 2 different  \u2502\n\u2502  AZs (EKS requires this).                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  - ALWAYS include IAM policy attachments (AmazonEKSClusterPolicy,            \u2502\n\u2502  AmazonEKSWorkerNodePolicy, AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryReadOnly,              \u2502\n\u2502  AmazonEKS_CNI_Policy).                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  - ALWAYS include security groups for the cluster and nodes.                 \u2502\n\u2502  - The design MUST include a `provider` block and `terraform {               \u2502\n\u2502  required_providers { } }` block.                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Agent: Universal Cloud Architect                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256f\n\n\n\u23f3 Cooling down for 10 seconds to prevent rate limits...\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 Crew Completion \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Crew Execution Completed                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  Name: crew                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  ID: 5c2e613c-091b-4520-b09c-7946af5961f1                                    \u2502\n\u2502  Final Output: PROJECT_SLUG: azure-aks-public-cluster-modern                 \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ```mermaid                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  graph TD                                                                    \u2502\n\u2502      User[User / DevOps] -->|HTTPS/443| AKS[Azure Kubernetes                 \u2502\n\u2502  Service<br/>AKS Cluster<br/>Public Endpoint]                                \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Pull Images| ACR[Azure Container Registry<br/>Managed Identity  \u2502\n\u2502  Access]                                                                     \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Logs/Metrics| LAWS[Log Analytics Workspace<br/>Container        \u2502\n\u2502  Insights]                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502      VNet[Virtual Network] --> Subnet1[Subnet 1<br/>Availability Zone        \u2502\n\u2502  1<br/>AKS Node Pool]                                                        \u2502\n\u2502      VNet --> Subnet2[Subnet 2<br/>Availability Zone 2<br/>NAT Gateway]      \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet1 --> AKS                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet2 --> NAT[NAT Gateway<br/>Outbound Internet Access]               \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -->|Pods| Subnet1                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ### Terraform Configuration                                                 \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 1. `versions.tf`                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  terraform {                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    required_version = \">= 1.6.0\"                                             \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    required_providers {                                                      \u2502\n\u2502      azurerm = {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        source  = \"hashicorp/azurerm\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502        version = \">= 4.0.0\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502      kubernetes = {                                                          \u2502\n\u2502        source  = \"hashicorp/kubernetes\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502        version = \">= 2.0.0\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 2. `provider.tf`                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  terraform {                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    backend \"local\" {                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      path = \"./terraform.tfstate\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  provider \"azurerm\" {                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    features {}                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  provider \"kubernetes\" {                                                     \u2502\n\u2502    host                   =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].host                         \u2502\n\u2502    client_certificate     =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].client_certifi  \u2502\n\u2502  cate)                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    client_key             =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].client_key)     \u2502\n\u2502    cluster_ca_certificate =                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  base64decode(azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kube_config[0].cluster_ca_cer  \u2502\n\u2502  tificate)                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 3. `variables.tf`                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"location\" {                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Azure region for resources\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"East US\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"resource_group_name\" {                                            \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Name of the resource group\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"rg-aks-prod\"                                               \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"vnet_address_space\" {                                             \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Address space for the Virtual Network\"                     \u2502\n\u2502    type        = list(string)                                                \u2502\n\u2502    default     = [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]                                             \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"subnet_prefixes\" {                                                \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Subnet address prefixes\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    type        = list(string)                                                \u2502\n\u2502    default     = [\"10.0.1.0/24\", \"10.0.2.0/24\"]                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"k8s_version\" {                                                    \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Kubernetes version for AKS\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = null # Will pull latest stable                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"acr_sku\" {                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"ACR SKU\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    type        = string                                                      \u2502\n\u2502    default     = \"Premium\"                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"tags\" {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502    description = \"Common tags for all resources\"                             \u2502\n\u2502    type        = map(string)                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    default     = {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      Environment = \"Production\"                                              \u2502\n\u2502      ManagedBy   = \"Terraform\"                                               \u2502\n\u2502      Project     = \"AKS-Public-Cluster\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### 4. `main.tf`                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  # Data source for latest stable AKS version                                 \u2502\n\u2502  data \"azurerm_kubernetes_versions\" \"latest\" {                               \u2502\n\u2502    location = var.location                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Resource Group                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_resource_group\" \"main\" {                                  \u2502\n\u2502    name     = var.resource_group_name                                        \u2502\n\u2502    location = var.location                                                   \u2502\n\u2502    tags     = var.tags                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Virtual Network and Subnets (2 AZs)                                       \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_virtual_network\" \"main\" {                                 \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"vnet-aks-main\"                                     \u2502\n\u2502    address_space       = var.vnet_address_space                              \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet\" \"aks_subnet\" {                                    \u2502\n\u2502    count                   = 2                                               \u2502\n\u2502    name                    = \"subnet-aks-${count.index}\"                     \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name     = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                \u2502\n\u2502    virtual_network_name    = azurerm_virtual_network.main.name               \u2502\n\u2502    address_prefixes        = [var.subnet_prefixes[count.index]]              \u2502\n\u2502    enforce_private_link_endpoint_network_policies = false                    \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # NAT Gateway for Outbound                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway\" \"main\" {                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"nat-gateway-aks\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    sku_name            = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway_public_ip\" \"main\" {                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"nat-gateway-pip-aks\"                               \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502    allocation_method   = \"Static\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_nat_gateway_association\" \"main\" {                         \u2502\n\u2502    nat_gateway_id = azurerm_nat_gateway.main.id                              \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[1].id                          \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Route Table                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_route_table\" \"main\" {                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"rt-aks-internal\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_route\" \"main\" {                                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                   = \"route-internet\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    address_prefix         = \"0.0.0.0/0\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    route_table_id         = azurerm_route_table.main.id                      \u2502\n\u2502    next_hop_type          = \"VirtualAppliance\"                               \u2502\n\u2502    next_hop_in_ip_address = azurerm_nat_gateway.main.private_ip_address      \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet_route_table_association\" \"main\" {                  \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[1].id                          \u2502\n\u2502    route_table_id = azurerm_route_table.main.id                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # NSGs                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_group\" \"main\" {                          \u2502\n\u2502    count             = 2                                                     \u2502\n\u2502    name              = \"nsg-aks-subnet-${count.index}\"                       \u2502\n\u2502    location          = var.location                                          \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    tags              = var.tags                                              \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main\" {                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowSSH\"                                  \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1001                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"22\"                                       \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main_http\" {                      \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowHTTP\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1002                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"80\"                                       \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_network_security_rule\" \"main_https\" {                     \u2502\n\u2502    name                        = \"AllowHTTPS\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    priority                    = 1003                                        \u2502\n\u2502    direction                   = \"Inbound\"                                   \u2502\n\u2502    access                       = \"Allow\"                                    \u2502\n\u2502    protocol                     = \"Tcp\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_port_range            = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_port_range       = \"443\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    source_address_prefix        = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    destination_address_prefix   = \"*\"                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name         = azurerm_resource_group.main.name            \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_name =                                             \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].name                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet_network_security_group_association\" \"main\" {       \u2502\n\u2502    subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks_subnet[count.index].id                \u2502\n\u2502    network_security_group_id =                                               \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_network_security_group.main[count.index].id                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Azure Container Registry                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_container_registry\" \"main\" {                              \u2502\n\u2502    name                     = \"acraksprod001\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name      = azurerm_resource_group.main.name               \u2502\n\u2502    location                 = var.location                                   \u2502\n\u2502    sku                      = var.acr_sku                                    \u2502\n\u2502    admin_enabled            = false                                          \u2502\n\u2502    tags                     = var.tags                                       \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # Log Analytics Workspace                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_log_analytics_workspace\" \"main\" {                         \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"law-aks-prod\"                                      \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"PerGB2018\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502    retention_in_days   = 30                                                  \u2502\n\u2502    tags                = var.tags                                            \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_monitor_container_insights\" \"main\" {                      \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    workspace_id        = azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.main.id             \u2502\n\u2502    cluster_name        = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.name                \u2502\n\u2502    kubernetes_version  = azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main.kubernetes_version  \u2502\n\u2502    depends_on          = [azurerm_kubernetes_cluster.main]                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  # AKS Cluster                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_kubernetes_cluster\" \"main\" {                              \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"aks-prod-cluster\"                                  \u2502\n\u2502    location            = var.location                                        \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    dns_prefix          = \"aksprod\"                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    linux_profile {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      admin_username = \"azureuser\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502      ssh_key {                                                               \u2502\n\u2502        key_data = file(\"~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub\")                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    network_profile {                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      network_plugin     = \"azure\"                                            \u2502\n\u2502      load_balancer_sku = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    addon_profile {                                                           \u2502\n\u2502      oms_agent {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        enabled    = true                                                     \u2502\n\u2502        log_analytics_workspace_resource_id =                                 \u2502\n\u2502  azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.main.id                                     \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    identity {                                                                \u2502\n\u2502      type         = \"SystemAssigned\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u